   "takeaways": [],
   "body": {
    "html": "<p class=\"pb-p\">Using crypto and DeFi today is an experience still scattered across dozens of chains, wallets, and bridges. Most people either give up custody to a centralized exchange or lose hours juggling gas, managing bridges, and stitching transactions together manually.</p><p class=\"pb-p\">near.com fixes that. It's a multi-chain super-app, powered by <a href=\"https://www.near.org/intents\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">NEAR Intents</a>. With <a href=\"http://near.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">near.com</a>, you can swap, go confidential, trade peer-to-peer across 35+ blockchains—all from a single account.&nbsp;</p><p class=\"pb-p\">near.com isn't a rebrand. It's a new unified experience built on top of NEAR Intents—the same infrastructure that has powered $13M+ in cross-chain volume for major wallets, DeFi platforms, and infrastructure providers such as Ledger, SwapKit, RHEA Finance, and more.&nbsp;</p><p class=\"pb-p\">Here's what you can do right now.</p><figure class=\"pb-fig pb-fig--free\" data-size=\"col\" data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"pb-fig__ph\"><img src=\"/images/blog/cms/near-com/a393a44d8c993ec0.webp\" height=\"323\" width=\"624\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\" class=\"pb-fig__img\"></div></figure><h2 id=\"swap-cross-chain-simplified\" class=\"pb-h2\" data-reveal=\"\"><span class=\"pb-h2__n\" aria-hidden=\"true\">01</span><span class=\"pb-h2__t\">Swap: Cross-Chain, Simplified</span></h2><p class=\"pb-p\">You define the outcome, not the route. No manual gas juggling or bridge management required. You get optimized routing in seconds—exchange-grade execution, without giving up control of your wallet.&nbsp;</p><p class=\"pb-p\">NEAR Intents has unlocked cross-chain connections to Bitcoin, Ethereum, Solana, TRON, ZCash, Stellar, Ripple—including routes that don't exist anywhere else. Under $0.01 per swap. No bridging. No destination chain gas tokens. One transaction from your existing wallet. near.com finally puts the engine that has powered billions in cross-chain DeFi into a single interface you directly control. One passkey login gives you access to 35+ networks. No seed phrases or wallet extensions required.</p><h2 id=\"confidential-accounts-your-transactions-your-business\" class=\"pb-h2\" data-reveal=\"\"><span class=\"pb-h2__n\" aria-hidden=\"true\">02</span><span class=\"pb-h2__t\">Confidential Accounts: Your Transactions, Your Business</span></h2><p class=\"pb-p\">In DeFi today, every action, position, and order is visible. This can result in frontrunning, strategy copying, and forced liquidations. Cryptographically private, ZK-only systems exist, but they only support a narrow set of operations and require client-side state sync.&nbsp;</p><p class=\"pb-p\">Confidential Accounts provide restricted visibility for institutions, enterprises, and DeFi users who need to manage cross-chain positions with confidence and control. Powered by a NEAR private shard, Confidential Accounts deliver a practical confidentiality layer that supports real DeFi workflows with compliance-aware design and cryptographically-secured execution.</p><p class=\"pb-p\">Confidential Accounts are a massive unlock for institutions and power users who need to protect positions from frontrunning and MEV, keep transactions confidential to prevent market signaling, and enable selective disclosure and auditable execution while preserving confidentiality, as well as a wide range of other enterprise use cases.&nbsp;</p><p class=\"pb-p\">In the app, simply toggle between your Main Account and Confidential Account. You can opt into confidentiality when you want it, across transfers, deposits, and withdrawals, with swaps coming soon.</p><p class=\"pb-p\">Read the full breakdown on Confidential Intents → <a href=\"/blog/confidential-intents\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">near.org/blog/confidential-intents</a></p><h2 id=\"peer-to-peer-settle-direct-no-middleman-required\" class=\"pb-h2\" data-reveal=\"\"><span class=\"pb-h2__n\" aria-hidden=\"true\">03</span><span class=\"pb-h2__t\">Peer-to-Peer: Settle Direct, No Middleman Required</span></h2><p class=\"pb-p\">Create a deal, set your terms, share a link. Both sides get exactly what was agreed—enforced by smart contracts. No escrow, no middleman.</p><p class=\"pb-p\">Peer-to-peer transactions on near.com let you negotiate directly with a counterparty for large or custom transactions without broadcasting to the market. Set the asset, the amount, the price. The counterparty accepts. Settlement is automatic and onchain.</p><h2 id=\"what-s-next-yield-ai-banking-and-more\" class=\"pb-h2\" data-reveal=\"\"><span class=\"pb-h2__n\" aria-hidden=\"true\">04</span><span class=\"pb-h2__t\">What’s Next: Yield, AI, Banking, and More</span></h2><p class=\"pb-p\">near.com is built on NEAR Protocol, with new chains added and new features shipping continuously. Some capabilities to look forward to in the near future:&nbsp;</p><ul class=\"pb-list\"><li>Earn: Access onchain yield across supported tokens and chains—built around your control.&nbsp;</li><li>AI Assistance: Always-on AI agents that suggest allocations, rebalancing, and optimization—you review and approve every action.</li><li>Real-World Assets: Tokenized equities, bonds, and more—accessible through one account.</li><li>Fiat Access: Move between fiat and stablecoins through integrated on-ramps and off-ramps.</li><li>Debit Cards: Spend your onchain assets with integrated card partners—transactions routed via NEAR Intents.</li></ul><p class=\"pb-p\">near.com is live. Try it now → <a>near.com</a></p>"
   },
